### API de Configuração de Menus
### Exemplos de chamadas HTTP para popular o banco de dados

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001/api/MenuConfiguracao
@token = SEU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI

### 1. Criar Menu - Dashboard
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "icone": "dashboard",
  "label": "Dashboard",
  "route": "/dashboard",
  "disabled": false,
  "ordem": 1,
  "empresaId": null
}

