### Buscar todos os menus
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar todos os menus de uma empresa específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/todos?empresaId=ID_DA_EMPRESA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar menu por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/MENU_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar menu (exemplo: habilitar Agendamentos)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/menu/MENU_ID_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "icone": "event",
  "label": "Agendamentos",
  "route": "/agendamentos",
  "disabled": false,
  "ordem": 3,
  "empresaId": null
}

### Remover menu
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menu/MENU_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reordenar menus
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu/reordenar
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

[
  {
    "id": "MENU_ID_1",
    "ordem": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "MENU_ID_2",
    "ordem": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "MENU_ID_3",
    "ordem": 3
  }
]
